# Three bots: follow `docs/servers.md`

- **Server 2 (`cormon-edge`, bot_test@huma.ai) and the Mattermost demo always run the newest main, with every
  feature on.** After every merge to main, once main's gate passes, update both without asking John
  (the steps in `docs/servers.md`), then update its versions table. John should never have to ask.
- **Server 1 (`cormon-demo`, the live bot) changes only when John says so.** John runs `./deploy/release.sh`
  himself; never release to it, never change its settings, never switch a feature on there without his "yes".
- Never restart the Mattermost demo while a demo may be on: ask first on demo days.
- Settings changes on a server wait for a second person (John approves with
  `CORMON_VM=<server> ./bin/cormon-cloud config approve settings <id>`); study rooms need a restart after.
